<title>BULGARIA: NO DEALS ON BULGARIA BOURSES, RABSI FLAT.</title>
<headline>NO DEALS ON BULGARIA BOURSES, RABSI FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The RABSI (Reuter All Bulgaria Stock Index) was unchanged from Friday's 41.14 points because there were no deals on the local stock market for a ninth day in a row, brokers said.</p>
<p>No repo deals in treasury paper were struck on Bulgarian bourses either, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Rumen Sokolov, Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
